      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Preparations complete, ser? This extermination\r\ntarget — a Behemoth, hazardous enow on its own,\r\nnow driven feral by the infection's encroachment.",
        "Jp" : "準備は万端か？\r\n今回の討伐対象は、ただでさえ\r\n危険度の高いベヘモットが\r\n侵食作用によって凶暴化した相手だからな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 455299,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "To say naught of its lair — the Fungal Colony\r\nCaves, blanketed in spores. Carry extra\r\nCorruption Preventatives. 'Twill\r\nnot go to waste, ser.",
        "Jp" : "おまけにヤツが潜む場所も\r\n菌胞がべったりの《菌糸の襲窟》だ\r\n抗侵薬は多めに持って損は無いぞ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 485972,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Truth be told, I'd fight beside you. But the post\r\nof Expedition Team Overseer and Area Master —\r\nrewarding though it is — binds my hands at\r\ntimes like these, ser—",
        "Jp" : "本当なら俺も同行して共に戦いたいんだが\r\n調査隊監督兼エリアマスターというのは\r\nやりがいはあっても\r\nこういう時に自由がききにくくてな――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482966,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "My apologies, ser. The task falls to you.",
